{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Scaredy Cat: The tale of Boo",
    "steam_appid": 3536490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/b6ecbe12450c30fbb864299501748ca4.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span>You are Boo, an average cat forced to find your courage, to free your home and save your friends. Fight, cast spells, glide and grapple you way through dangerous lands to become a powerful warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world on foot or by glider, climbing and sliding down cat rails or by grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or find friends to lend a helping paw and do it together. You can find many allies to help you, some will teach you magic, some will sell you weapons and items and others will fight beside you with their own set of skills, ranging from many melee weapons, bow and arrow or even magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/79ecb6f269e88ecd97b642e25626a304.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your paws or a wide variety of weapons. Everything from one handed swords, sword and shield, duel daggers or duel swords, giant two handed swords, two handed hammers, spears and more. Each weapon has its own fighting style and damage type, based on rarity. The more rare it is, the more powerful it is. Every weapon also has a damage type. It can be anything from physical damage, poison damage, frost or ice damage (which can stop or slow down the enemy), lighting damage and fire damage. But be careful, your enemies can have these weapons too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/2c7ce3dee7711b0c263e9c1c8e5a30aa.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you would rather fight your enemy from a distance, maybe the bow and arrow is for you. There are different types of bows with unique stats and many arrow types as well. Common sharp and deadly arrows are easier to find in the world. You can find fire arrows which will catch your enemies on fire or arrows dipped in poison for some extra damage and effects. Lightning arrows will send chain lightning to some enemies that are close to your target, hitting more than one target with a single shot. Ice arrows can freeze enemies in their tracks. Arrows with dynamite attached are good for big damage and groups. Rain arrows will fall from the sky in a single shot - good for people with bad aim. Finally, an ultimate arrow will be added if the stretch goal is met. Tip - head shots to the unaware will result in a cool assassination animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/7be154a6b3b802bb1415ea9d22d7bc2d.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you're a more fancy cat - magic could be your calling. There are plenty of spells you can learn, you just need to find the right teachers. You can learn many different kinds of elemental magic, everything from fire, ice, frost, poison, lightning and more. Each element has its own unique spell types you can cast. You can throw fireballs, plant traps for enemies to walk on, raise ice spikes from the ground, chase your enemies with tornados, and more. Each element also has its own ultimate spell such as, calling down a meteor, summoning a blizzard, conjuring up poison pits and raining down lightning storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/392384e5954ef1a5fc3968e2b70f22cd.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The melee combat, archery and magic can be mixed together, so you can customize and play how you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/bb7efe3cfa360f90ef88ea559743efb9.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many enemy types to battle. Enemies can use almost everything you can, from swords, daggers, giant blades and spears, to magic welders. Enemies also range in difficulty and style. You will also come across many tribe types as well. Everything from Viking Ducks, magical penguins, rain deer, warrior moose, ninja turtles, spiders, dragons to more rare creatures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/d781023101d2bd6d7c0461c95e31f5be.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of my favorite features is the tribe feature. Characters are assigned to a group and will only fight others not in their group. This means that sometimes the enemy of my enemy is my friend. All other tribes will attack you, but sometimes you will see some enemies fight each other when they are from different tribes. This means you can have everything from one-on-one fights to bigger battles with different groups all fighting each other until one group is left., so make sure you build a good tribe to fight by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special places exist all over the world. Here are just a few you can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/bbb54cd8e2daefeda214fb0a910a385a.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/082633568fd2dc0e73c9989b8da0109c.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/bdceabfec9971b0e7d46184eb8f50845.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/d175953e7fbfed54d23c77f9c12bd804.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/cf6fdbe179983adcb16bfb8920e9ff9a.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join the fight to become a powerful warrior and save Boo's home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/0662d7e09e426dc1eca3894874a2ff29.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/b6ecbe12450c30fbb864299501748ca4.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span>You are Boo, an average cat forced to find your courage, to free your home and save your friends. Fight, cast spells, glide and grapple you way through dangerous lands to become a powerful warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world on foot or by glider, climbing and sliding down cat rails or by grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or find friends to lend a helping paw and do it together. You can find many allies to help you, some will teach you magic, some will sell you weapons and items and others will fight beside you with their own set of skills, ranging from many melee weapons, bow and arrow or even magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/79ecb6f269e88ecd97b642e25626a304.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your paws or a wide variety of weapons. Everything from one handed swords, sword and shield, duel daggers or duel swords, giant two handed swords, two handed hammers, spears and more. Each weapon has its own fighting style and damage type, based on rarity. The more rare it is, the more powerful it is. Every weapon also has a damage type. It can be anything from physical damage, poison damage, frost or ice damage (which can stop or slow down the enemy), lighting damage and fire damage. But be careful, your enemies can have these weapons too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/2c7ce3dee7711b0c263e9c1c8e5a30aa.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you would rather fight your enemy from a distance, maybe the bow and arrow is for you. There are different types of bows with unique stats and many arrow types as well. Common sharp and deadly arrows are easier to find in the world. You can find fire arrows which will catch your enemies on fire or arrows dipped in poison for some extra damage and effects. Lightning arrows will send chain lightning to some enemies that are close to your target, hitting more than one target with a single shot. Ice arrows can freeze enemies in their tracks. Arrows with dynamite attached are good for big damage and groups. Rain arrows will fall from the sky in a single shot - good for people with bad aim. Finally, an ultimate arrow will be added if the stretch goal is met. Tip - head shots to the unaware will result in a cool assassination animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/7be154a6b3b802bb1415ea9d22d7bc2d.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you're a more fancy cat - magic could be your calling. There are plenty of spells you can learn, you just need to find the right teachers. You can learn many different kinds of elemental magic, everything from fire, ice, frost, poison, lightning and more. Each element has its own unique spell types you can cast. You can throw fireballs, plant traps for enemies to walk on, raise ice spikes from the ground, chase your enemies with tornados, and more. Each element also has its own ultimate spell such as, calling down a meteor, summoning a blizzard, conjuring up poison pits and raining down lightning storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/392384e5954ef1a5fc3968e2b70f22cd.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The melee combat, archery and magic can be mixed together, so you can customize and play how you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/bb7efe3cfa360f90ef88ea559743efb9.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many enemy types to battle. Enemies can use almost everything you can, from swords, daggers, giant blades and spears, to magic welders. Enemies also range in difficulty and style. You will also come across many tribe types as well. Everything from Viking Ducks, magical penguins, rain deer, warrior moose, ninja turtles, spiders, dragons to more rare creatures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/d781023101d2bd6d7c0461c95e31f5be.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of my favorite features is the tribe feature. Characters are assigned to a group and will only fight others not in their group. This means that sometimes the enemy of my enemy is my friend. All other tribes will attack you, but sometimes you will see some enemies fight each other when they are from different tribes. This means you can have everything from one-on-one fights to bigger battles with different groups all fighting each other until one group is left., so make sure you build a good tribe to fight by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special places exist all over the world. Here are just a few you can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/bbb54cd8e2daefeda214fb0a910a385a.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/082633568fd2dc0e73c9989b8da0109c.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/bdceabfec9971b0e7d46184eb8f50845.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/d175953e7fbfed54d23c77f9c12bd804.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/cf6fdbe179983adcb16bfb8920e9ff9a.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join the fight to become a powerful warrior and save Boo's home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536490/extras/0662d7e09e426dc1eca3894874a2ff29.avif?t=1740761688\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
